            <a href="/freshmen" class="px-8 py-4 bg-feu-yellow text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-lg shadow-xl shadow-feu-yellow/20 hover:bg-yellow-400 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all">
                Apply Now
